    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d535">

                <pb facs="0701" n="577" xml:id="pg577"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/2044: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting President of the Technical Board</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-04-18T17:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">April 18,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received April 20—11:29
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Referring to my cable of March 14th, 7 p.m. Chinese directors again forcing
                    railway to make improper payments to the Chinese interests: Technical Board
                    taking positive issue with the Chinese.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
